WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.120
Thank you so much for acknowledging Antifa

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:06.540
and for directing your administration to treat them

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:07.720
as domestic terrorists.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.040
It's going to be really challenging

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:14.680
because how they organize is that they are decentralized,

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:18.080
autonomous, and they operate on deception.

00:00:18.639 --> 00:00:21.219
And we're still to this day told that they don't exist,

00:00:21.219 --> 00:00:23.000
that it's a figment of our imagination.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:27.860
I think the DOJ could look at federal conspiracy charges.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.940
The state of California in San Diego County last year broke

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.740
up an Antifa cell in San Diego.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:36.259
And I think maybe perhaps the State Department should

00:00:36.259 --> 00:00:39.200
designate Antifa, its international arm,

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.599
as a foreign terrorist organization, FTO.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.360
So thank you so much for this invitation, Mr. President.

00:00:44.959 --> 00:00:45.259
Thank you.

00:00:45.459 --> 00:00:46.599
Thank you very much, Andy.

00:00:46.599 --> 00:00:48.700
Great. That's a rough time you had, huh?

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:53.099
So the chokeout was almost the end, you felt?

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:56.919
Yeah, that was my only near-death experience

00:00:56.939 --> 00:01:00.860
in my life, and I'm quite shaken when I think about it now.

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:05.980
It really feels unbelievable to me that on the streets

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:08.860
of America that this type of violence against citizens.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:11.800
So routine and accepted and cheered on by people.

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:14.980
Although, you know, in the immediate aftermath

00:01:14.980 --> 00:01:17.620
of Mr. Kirk's assassination, we saw again that type

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:20.839
of depravity play out on quite large swaths of the left.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:22.660
So there's a.

